    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83d\udd25 About Inazuma Eleven Team Builder </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inazuma Eleven Team Builder is a  tool-game designed for all Inazuma Eleven enthusiasts! Create your dream team, organize your players, and strategize your formations just like a true coach. \u26bd </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Build Your Ultimate Team </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select, customize, and organize your squad with your favorite players from the Inazuma Eleven universe. Whether you're recreating legendary teams or inventing new strategies, this tool is designed for people who love tactical planning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Team Management \u2013 Choose players, set formations, and assign roles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Custom Lineups \u2013 Design formations and strategies for every match scenario.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Save &amp; Share \u2013 Keep track of your teams and share them with others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 Join us on Discord and Steam to be part of the discussion and share your creations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Create, strategize, and lead your team to victory! \ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83d\udd25 About Inazuma Eleven Team Builder </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inazuma Eleven Team Builder is a  tool-game designed for all Inazuma Eleven enthusiasts! Create your dream team, organize your players, and strategize your formations just like a true coach. \u26bd </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Build Your Ultimate Team </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select, customize, and organize your squad with your favorite players from the Inazuma Eleven universe. Whether you're recreating legendary teams or inventing new strategies, this tool is designed for people who love tactical planning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Team Management \u2013 Choose players, set formations, and assign roles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Custom Lineups \u2013 Design formations and strategies for every match scenario.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Save &amp; Share \u2013 Keep track of your teams and share them with others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 Join us on Discord and Steam to be part of the discussion and share your creations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Create, strategize, and lead your team to victory! \ud83d\udd25</p>",
